### Create AI agent
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Qarz undirish - o'zbekcha",
  "description": "Kunlik qarzdorlar bazasi uchun",
  "scenarioId": 1,
  "language": "uz-UZ",
  "ttsVoice": "nigora",
  "languageVoices": { "uz-UZ": "nigora", "ru-RU": "alena" },
  "persona": "AI_ASSISTANT",
  "ambientSound": "OFFICE",
  "emotionAdaptiveVoice": true,
  "dtmfInputEnabled": false,
  "sipTrunkIds": [1],
  "enabled": true
}

### Filter AI agents
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20,
  "orders": { "CREATED_AT": "DESC" },
  "enabled": true
}

### Get one
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update (same shape as create; scenarioId may change)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Qarz undirish - ruscha",
  "scenarioId": 1,
  "language": "ru-RU",
  "ttsVoice": "alena",
  "persona": "HUMAN_LIKE",
  "llmModel": "gemini-2.5-flash",
  "temperature": 0.6,
  "maxOutputTokens": 300,
  "enabled": true
}

### Delete (409 while a campaign or inbound route still uses it)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
